<Page title="About Crisp & Cook" description="Learn about Crisp & Cook and our approach to fast, reliable air fryer and rice cooker recipes for everyday home cooks.">
  <p>Hi, and welcome to <strong>{SITE.name}</strong>! This site is dedicated to helping beginner cooks, students, and busy households put together comforting, budget-friendly meals without spending hours in the kitchen.</p>

  <p>Most weeknights, nobody has an hour to cook or a sink full of dishes to scrub. That is why we focus on the two countertop appliances that do the heavy lifting: the <strong>air fryer</strong> and the <strong>rice cooker</strong>. Every guide is structured to give you clear temperatures, realistic timing ranges, smart ingredient swaps, and practical troubleshooting tips.</p>

  <h2>What You'll Find Here</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Air fryer dinners, snacks, and sides:</strong> Quick recipes focused on crisp textures and even cooking without deep frying.</li>
    <li><strong>Rice cooker one-pot meals:</strong> Hands-off dinners that cook grains, proteins, and vegetables together.</li>
    <li><strong>15-minute weeknight meals:</strong> Fast options designed for busy schedules and minimal prep work.</li>
    <li><strong>Budget-friendly recipes:</strong> Everyday meals built around affordable pantry staples and accessible supermarket ingredients.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Our Recipe Approach</h2>
  <p>Cooking at home shouldn't require guesswork or complicated culinary jargon. In every recipe on <strong>{SITE.name}</strong>, we aim to include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Clear Measurements:</strong> Both US customary and metric measurements so you can cook comfortably from anywhere.</li>
    <li><strong>Why Steps Matter:</strong> Short explanations behind key steps—like why patting proteins dry helps them brown or why spacing food in an air fryer basket prevents steaming.</li>
    <li><strong>Food Safety First:</strong> Reliable internal temperature guidelines and safe storage and reheating instructions so you know when your food is safely cooked.</li>
    <li><strong>Flexible Substitutions:</strong> Practical swaps for common pantry ingredients so you can adapt recipes to what you already have on hand.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Have a question, feedback, or a recipe request? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch with us here</a>.</p>
</Page>
